# adv_bridge.voc — Short adverbs that sit between a finite verb and its object NP
# ("seco PRIMEIRO as mãos"). Used by score_verb: <word> ADV DET → +1 VERB,
# helping a verb reading beat a noun reading when an adverb intervenes.
# Extend with other manner/sequence adverbs that can split verb + object.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

ainda
apenas
bem
então
imediatamente
já
logo
mal
nunca
primeiro
rapidamente
sempre
também
